{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010780/extras/7ab7a97054ff244dbfa26b22b7a274c6.avif?t=1762333411\" width=1117 height=217 /></span>OLYEN is a first-person puzzle and exploration game set in a forgotten valley once inhabited by four sages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across ruins, mechanisms, and\u00a0impossible structures, you\u2019ll uncover their scattered writings notes, diaries, and reports that piece together a non-linear story of knowledge, ambition, and loss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every puzzle in OLYEN is part of a larger mechanism. As you explore, you\u2019ll observe how each element connects to the whole.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed to evoke curiosity and calm, OLYEN invites you to slow down, look closely, and experience the quiet satisfaction of discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The journey lasts around three hours, offering a compact yet atmospheric experience focused on observation, logic, and the joy of finding meaning in a forgotten world.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4010780?t=1762333411","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4010780?t=1762333411","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010780/a9a23eb268227baf2a1adf29b909d4589a863c3a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762333411","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010780/a9a23eb268227baf2a1adf29b909d4589a863c3a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762333411","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010780/extras/7ab7a97054ff244dbfa26b22b7a274c6.avif?t=1762333411\" width=1117 height=217 /></span>OLYEN is a first-person puzzle and exploration game set in a forgotten valley once inhabited by four sages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across ruins, mechanisms, and\u00a0impossible structures, you\u2019ll uncover their scattered writings notes, diaries, and reports that piece together a non-linear story of knowledge, ambition, and loss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every puzzle in OLYEN is part of a larger mechanism. As you explore, you\u2019ll observe how each element connects to the whole.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed to evoke curiosity and calm, OLYEN invites you to slow down, look closely, and experience the quiet satisfaction of discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The journey lasts around three hours, offering a compact yet atmospheric experience focused on observation, logic, and the joy of finding meaning in a forgotten world.</p>","developers":["Adrian Ortega Marzal"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010780/040623bf1e972d395c13c2c8e620e593214646cf/header.jpg?t=1762333411","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4010780/1793708396/c27666cfba69b049132e2da14bc994c27a6ce2da/1762331986/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762333408","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4010780/1793708396/c27666cfba69b049132e2da14bc994c27a6ce2da/1762331986/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762333408","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4010780/1793708396/c27666cfba69b049132e2da14bc994c27a6ce2da/1762331986/hls_264_ma